** ------------------------------------------------------------
** CalculiX 3D Steel Cantilever Beam - Pure Linear Static Benchmark
** Geometry: 20 x 20 x 200 mm (L/h = 10), C3D20R quadratic hexahedra
** Fixed at z = 0 (NNFIX). Uniform pressure 0.2 MPa on lateral face (TOP).
** ------------------------------------------------------------
*INCLUDE, INPUT=all.msh
*INCLUDE, INPUT=NFIX.nam
*INCLUDE, INPUT=NTIP.nam

*MATERIAL, NAME=STEEL
*ELASTIC
210000.0, 0.3

*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=Eall, MATERIAL=STEEL

*BOUNDARY
NNFIX, 1, 3, 0.0

*STEP
*STATIC
*DLOAD
*INCLUDE, INPUT=TOP.dlo

*NODE FILE
U
*NODE PRINT, NSET=NNTIP
U
*EL FILE
S
*END STEP
